# The held-out test sentences must never be committed (Step 77). Only their
# SHA-256 hash is, in research/language/heldout/heldout-v1.sha256. The file
# itself stays with a writer or labeler until the Step 108 experiment; if it
# were in this repository the rule developer could read it, which is exactly
# what freezing is meant to prevent. See docs/RESEARCH_PLAN.md.
research/language/heldout/*.jsonl
research/language/heldout/*.csv
research/language/heldout/*.tsv
research/language/heldout/v1/

# Working state written by scripts/second-device.mjs when it stands in for a
# second phone (Steps 71-72). It is one machine's sync position, not shared.
second-device.state.json
*.state.json
